Upstream-PR:     none (K2Go carry patch)
Upstream-Status: not sent upstream (K2Go-specific R2 mirror)
Applies-to:      roles/kiwix/defaults/main.yml
Summary:         Point the kiwix-tools download at the K2Go R2 mirror (upstream/kiwix/kiwix-tools) instead of download.kiwix.org. kiwix.org has been slow and flaky and stalled a bake (the arm64 basic leg timed out fetching kiwix-tools, curl rc=92, which failed the whole run). The R2 mirror is refreshed weekly by .github/workflows/upstream-mirror.yml and serves the SAME generic, version-agnostic file name (kiwix-tools_linux-<arch>.tar.gz). The role still builds the name from kiwix_arch, so nothing here pins a version; only the base host changes. Drop this patch if kiwix.org reliability returns or upstream adds a mirror variable.

diff --git a/roles/kiwix/defaults/main.yml b/roles/kiwix/defaults/main.yml
index 9ed6ecb..0fcc306 100644
--- a/roles/kiwix/defaults/main.yml
+++ b/roles/kiwix/defaults/main.yml
@@ -21,7 +21,11 @@
 # - index = directory for legacy *.zim.idx's
 kiwix_library_xml: "{{ iiab_zim_path }}/library.xml"

-kiwix_base_url: https://download.kiwix.org/release/kiwix-tools/
+# K2GO-563: build from the K2Go R2 mirror (upstream/kiwix/kiwix-tools), refreshed weekly by
+# .github/workflows/upstream-mirror.yml. kiwix.org has been slow and flaky; the bake must not
+# depend on it at build time. The generic (version-agnostic) name in kiwix_tar_gz is served
+# from R2, so no version number is pinned here.
+kiwix_base_url: https://pub-d64c885cef6c42db8c7925144d73d0ee.r2.dev/upstream/kiwix/kiwix-tools/
 #kiwix_base_url: https://download.kiwix.org/nightly/2022-10-04/
 #kiwix_base_url: "{{ iiab_download_url }}/"    # e.g. https://download.iiab.io/packages/
